              "instruction": "kuṭṭikaḷ pāṭṭinṟe tāḷattil kai koṭṭi. — The children clapped to the rhythm of the song.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *kuṭṭikaḷ pāṭṭinṟe tāḷattil kai koṭṭi.* — The children clapped to the rhythm of the song.]"
