          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സംവിധായകൻ (saṁvidhāyakan) is built on Sanskrit saṁvidhāna, \"arrangement, management\" (Monier-Williams), with the agent ending -അകൻ: the one who arranges."
